   Gao, Dexin; Wang, Shuai; Wu, Xutong; Zhou, Sha; Li, Zidong; Chen, Peng; Fu, Bojie, Beijing Normal Univ, Fac Geog Sci, State Key Lab Earth Surface Proc \& Resource Ecol, Beijing 100875, Peoples R China.
